{"unit_id":"U1s1-king__dsh-live2d-avemujica#readme-6","repo":"U1s1-king/dsh-live2d-avemujica","commit":"5da138eee99d87854181e78cc75fd9394894b5dc","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-live2d-avemujica README · 说明：- **路由前缀**：`/avem-assets`（与 Roselia `/ro-assets`、MyGO `/pet-assets`、RAS `/ras-assets`、HHW `/hhw-assets` 互不冲突，可多插件共存）\n- **localStorage**：使用 `avem-waifu-waifu-display` / `avem-waifu-waifu-pos` 独立键，与其他桌宠插件隔离\n- **模型来源**：BANDORI 独立版全量数据（zst 压缩包解压转换），model.json → index.json\n- **台词包**：按 5 角色人设撰写（DOLORIS 温柔坚定 / MORTIS 沉默寡言 / TIMORIS 冷静可靠 / AMORIS 爱出风头 / OBLIVIONIS 优雅强大）","source":"extracted","section":"说明"}
